# 行尾规范（P4 治理补充）：源码/文档统一 LF 入库，避免 CRLF/LF 混合导致 git 全文件 diff 噪音
* text=auto

*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理/脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
